National Instruments error text
-------------------------------
The error messages in src/lverror/_messages.json and the excerpts in tests/fixtures/sources
are text written by National Instruments Corporation (now part of Emerson). They are
reproduced only to identify the error codes they describe. Their origins, sizes and SHA-256
checksums are recorded in tests/fixtures/sources/MANIFEST.json.

LabVIEW Wiki
------------
The 41 NI-DAQmx messages tagged "daqmx-wiki" in src/lverror/_messages.json, and the files
tests/fixtures/sources/daqmx-wiki.txt and tests/fixtures/sources/wiki-families.txt, come from
the LabVIEW Wiki (https://labviewwiki.org/wiki/NI-DAQmx_Error_Code_Family and
https://labviewwiki.org/wiki/List_of_errors), whose content is available under the Creative
Commons Attribution 3.0 License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Changes made
here: the messages keep the wiki text with line breaks and runs of spaces collapsed; the
fixture files keep only the rows for the shipped codes and the LabVIEW, NI-DAQmx and VISA
family rows.
